    "title": "Buffalo Bills Mobile",
    "description": "Welcome to the official mobile app of the Buffalo Bills, presented by M&T Bank and tailor-made for the most passionate and knowledgeable fanbase in the NFL. Stay locked in with exclusive team content all year long and make game day go smoothly with mobile ticketing. Plus, score live streaming video, breaking news, real-time statistics and drive updates, and on-demand highlights! \r\n\r\nFeatures include:\r\n\r\nGame day: Mobile ticketing\r\n\r\nNews: Real-time breaking news, previews of upcoming matchups, postgame recaps and \r\nplayer features\r\n\r\nVideo: Live streaming video, on-demand highlights, feature stories, press conferences, coach and player interviews, and more\r\n\r\nPhotos: Stunning HQ galleries from games and practices\r\n\r\nAudio: Official team podcasts and interviews\r\n\r\nStats: Real-time statistics and scores from the official NFL stats engine, head-to-head matchup insights, player stats, drive updates, box scores and league-wide stats\r\n\r\nStandings: Division and conference standings\r\n\r\nDepth chart: Up-to-date offense, defense and special teams \r\n\r\nSchedule: Schedule of upcoming games, box scores from previous games, ticket purchases for future games\r\n\r\nFor more Bills news and info, visit www.buffalobills.com \r\nFor support: Tweet @yinzcam or email support@yinzcam.com\r\n\r\nThe official mobile app of the Buffalo Bills presented by M&T Bank is created and maintained by YinzCam, Inc., on behalf of the Buffalo Bills.\r\n\r\nPlease note: This app features Nielsen's proprietary measurement software which contributes to market research, like Nielsen's TV Ratings. Please see https://priv-policy.imrworldwide.com/priv/mobile/us/en/optout.html  for more information.",
